{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - User - Account - Administrator Role Assigned to an Okta User",
	"Description": "An administrator role was granted to an Okta user. This is the single most direct privilege escalation in Okta: the granted account can then change policies, create API tokens, and add identity providers.\n\nEvent type: user.account.privilege.grant\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/elastic/detection-rules/integrations/okta/persistence_administrator_role_assigned_to_okta_user/\n- https://github.com/elastic/detection-rules/tree/main/rules/integrations/okta/persistence_administrator_role_assigned_to_okta_user.toml",
